kcsdi-rs
========

The KC901 protocol knowledge in this project is informed by the KC901
programming manual (B002-008, 3rd edition, KeXinShe) and cross-checked
against the documented device behavior of the KCSDI application
(MEASALL Technology, https://www.measall.com/). Both works document how
the instrument behaves on the wire, and both served as references for
docs/reference/. Selected facts were verified against a real KC901V.

With gratitude to the authors of the KC901 programming manual and to the
KCSDI project.
